---
/**
 * /privacy/ — Privacy Policy.
 *
 * EVERY CLAIM HERE WAS CHECKED AGAINST THE SOURCE. The project was searched for
 * analytics, tag managers, pixels, ad scripts, cookies, localStorage,
 * sessionStorage, IndexedDB, consent platforms, newsletter providers, accounts,
 * payments, databases, third-party embeds and remote scripts or stylesheets.
 * None exists; see `siteFacts` in `src/config/legal.ts` and the audit recorded
 * in project-brief.md §13v.
 *
 * So this policy describes a site that genuinely does very little, rather than
 * reciting the usual template. In particular it does NOT say "we collect your
 * IP address", "we use cookies" or "we use Google Analytics", because none of
 * those statements would be true today.
 *
 * It is also careful about the one real nuance: the search form puts the query
 * in the URL, and a URL is part of the request sent to whatever service hosts
 * the site. That is stated plainly instead of being glossed over.
 *
 * This is website copy, not legal advice, and no compliance claim is made.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/page/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What information is and is not handled when you visit SpaceWise Living."
  bare
>
  <LegalPage
    eyebrow="Legal / Privacy"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    intro="SpaceWise Living respects your privacy. This page explains what information may be handled when you visit this website and how it is used."
    contactIntro="If you have a question about this policy, you can get in touch once a contact route is available."
  >
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} is a static content website. It has no accounts, no comments,
      no newsletter, no shop and no database. It does not run analytics, does
      not use advertising or tracking scripts, and does not set cookies of its
      own. The sections below describe that in more detail.
    </p>

    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not currently ask you for any personal information.
      There is no contact form, no account or login, no newsletter signup, no
      comment system and no checkout, so there is no mechanism on this site
      through which you can submit your name, email address or other personal
      details.
    </p>
    <p>
      A contact route for {site.name} has not been configured yet. If one is
      added later — for example an email address — anything you choose to send
      through it would reach whoever operates that channel, and this policy
      would be updated to say so.
    </p>

    <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
    <p>
      This site runs no analytics service, no tag manager, no advertising or
      measurement pixel, and no third-party tracking script. It does not build a
      profile of you, and it does not record what you read.
    </p>
    <p>
      Two ordinary things still happen, because they are how the web works:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Your browser requests pages from a server.</strong> Any web
        host can keep standard request logs, which typically include details
        such as an IP address and the page requested. {site.name} does not
        operate or configure such logging, and no hosting provider has been set
        up for this project yet.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Search terms appear in the page address.</strong> The search
        page filters results in your browser, but submitting a search puts your
        words into the URL — for example
        {' '}<code>/search/?q=under+sink</code>. Like any address you visit,
        that forms part of the request your browser makes to the host. This site
        does not store, transmit or analyse your search terms anywhere else.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>
      This website sets no cookies of its own. It does not use
      <code>localStorage</code>, <code>sessionStorage</code> or any other
      browser storage, and there is no consent banner because there is nothing
      to consent to.
    </p>
    <p>
      Websites you reach by following a link from here are separate and may use
      cookies and similar technologies of their own, under their own policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Fonts and other assets</h2>
    <p>
      The typefaces, images, stylesheet and scripts used by this site are served
      from this site itself. No font, script or stylesheet is loaded from a
      third-party service, so visiting a page does not cause your browser to
      contact another company.
    </p>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
      Because the site collects nothing itself, there is nothing for it to use,
      share, sell or transfer. No personal information is processed for
      advertising, profiling or any other purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party websites and links</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} may link to other websites — for example retailers, makers or
      reference material. Those sites are independently operated. Their content,
      privacy practices and use of cookies are theirs, not ours, and this policy
      does not apply once you leave this site. It is worth reading their own
      policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} is intended to support itself in part through affiliate links,
      which means some future links may earn a commission when a purchase is
      made through them. <strong>No affiliate programme has been set up and no
      affiliate links are published on this site today.</strong> When that
      changes, following such a link may allow the destination retailer to
      record that you arrived from here, under that retailer's own policy. The
      {' '}<a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> explains the
      arrangement in more detail.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      This site has no database, no user accounts and no server-side storage of
      personal information, so there is no store of personal data to retain or
      delete, and no retention period to state.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      There is no account to close, no mailing list to leave and no cookie
      preference to set, because none of those exist here. Your browser's own
      controls — private browsing, blocking scripts, clearing site data — work
      on this site as they do anywhere else.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This website is general-interest home organization content and is not
      directed at children. It does not knowingly collect information from
      anyone, including children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      This policy describes the website as it is currently built. It will be
      updated if the site starts doing something new — for example adding
      analytics, a newsletter or a contact form. The date at the top of this
      page shows when the wording last changed.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
